## Purpose
- Provide quick navigation for an AI agent working in this repository.

## Source of truth
- `docs/*.md`
- `docs/*.mb`

## Do
- Read in this order before coding:
  1. `architecture.md`
  2. `../services/AGENT.mb` (when changing anything under `services/`)
  3. `gateway.mb`
  4. `auth.mb`
  5. `organization.mb` / `notifications.mb` / `chat.mb` (as needed)
  6. `errors.mb`
  7. `database.mb`
  8. `frontend.mb`
  9. `backend.mb`
  10. `runbook.mb`
  11. `coding-style.mb`
- Use file-specific docs for implementation details, not assumptions.

## Don't
- Do not treat docs as higher priority than actual code/config; verify against source files.
- Do not skip `runbook.mb` before runtime checks.

## Checklist
- Correct doc selected for planned change area.
- Endpoint/port/config names copied exactly from source files.
